<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines' 91-day bill rate at 11.476 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippines' 91-day bill rate at 11.476 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' bellwether 91-day Treasury bill rate was marginally lower at 11.476 percent against 11.48 percent registered a week ago, the Bureau of Treasury said on Monday.</p>
</text>
